 - Reports: `therapist_load` counts booked appointments per therapist per day.
 - Waitlist: urgent entries first, then by request time, then in the order added.
 - SMS: Bulkie batches are split into calls of at most 50 messages.
+- Reminders: `send_reminders` sends one SMS per booked appointment (date, time and clinic name only, no treatment) and returns the number sent.
